<title>UK: J.P. Morgan leads $400 mln asset-backed bond.</title>
<headline>J.P. Morgan leads $400 mln asset-backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FIRST BANK CORPORATE CARD MASTER TRUST SERIES 1997-1</p>
<p> AMT    $394.8 MLN    COUPON     **	  LEGAL MAT   15.FEB.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE   S27.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+30 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**TO BE PRICED. S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>		EXPECTED MATURITY 15.MAR.02, AVG LIFE 4.97 YEARS</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS UK</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE ARE ALSO CLASS B NOTES OF $6.3 MLN, TO BE</p>
<p>		PRICED 45 BP OVER TREASURIES, RATED A2/A</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
